{
    "article_summary": "The article describes the synthesis of a photocatalytic metal-organic framework (MOF), UiO-67-Ru(bpy)3, by incorporating a Ru(II) complex into a Zr(IV)-based UiO-67 framework via postsynthetic modification (PSM). The resulting heterogeneous catalyst demonstrates efficient and recyclable activity for the aerobic oxidative hydroxylation of arylboronic acids to phenols under near-UV and visible light irradiation, maintaining stability over five catalytic cycles.",
